# Safe Changes

- Prefer surgical diffs; one module at a time.
- Do not refactor productive logic unless explicitly requested.
- Do not change API contracts, UI behavior, or database data.
- Do not run migrations, seeds, cleanup, backfill, or delete scripts unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve backward compatibility and legacy `companyId = null` fallbacks.
- Controllers: parse → service → JSON. Business logic stays in services.
- Reuse existing utilities (`isSameCompany`, `requireCompanyForAdmin`, `openSecureFile`).
- When unsure, document in `docs/tooling/NEXT-STEPS.md` instead of guessing.

Full policy: `CLAUDE.md`.
